                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes. Looking at it now, it's pretty silly, not sure why i did that.\n\nProbably too focused on reducing the scope of the local variable and forgot to consider the useless return type on the functions which were broken out.\n\nChanged it to return the `ret` in the caller instead like before."
