                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "You've defeated nrvo in this patch.  If you turn on -Wnvro on clang (which separately I'm trying to do in bmcweb here if you're interested) you will see this code likely now triggers a warning:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/80871"
                },
